      "tree_id": "04b50269aeb0b66664f108d19b0991b1738b11db",
      "message": "fix: settle deadline-limited searches atomically\n\nClassify a typed worker RPC timeout as E_DEADLINE when the whole-search deadline limits its grant, then settle the live search lease as terminal failed in one transaction. Preserve ordinary source failures, prior cancellation and revocation winners, unknown accounting, and earlier frozen results.\n\nAppend five native regressions and preserve the original real recovery tests. Retain both previous CI histories, independent old-code counterexamples, final-library probes, genuine schema migration, full 27-suite regression and 15-suite ASan/UBSan evidence. Current local inputs and summaries were independently audited; this commit requires its own Linux and Windows CI.",
